### 3.4 Configuration Specifications

**RBAC Role Configuration**:

```json
{
  "roles": {
    "Developer": {
      "permissions": {
        "topics": {
          "view": "scope:{business_unit}.*",
          "browse": "scope:{business_unit}.*",
          "export": true
        },
        "data-masking": {
          "bypass": false
        },
        "rate-limits": {
          "messages-per-5min": 100,
          "exports-per-day": 20
        }
      }
    },
    "ProductionDeveloper": {
      "permissions": {
        "topics": {
          "view": "prod:{business_unit}.*",
          "browse": "prod:{business_unit}.*",
          "export": true
        },
        "data-masking": {
          "bypass": false
        },
        "rate-limits": {
          "messages-per-5min": 50,
          "exports-per-day": 10
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Data Masking Policy Configuration**:

```sql
-- Lenses SQL Processor: PHI/PII masking
CREATE POLICY mask_pii_phi
ON TOPICS MATCHING 'medicaid.*', 'claims.*', 'patient.*'
MASK FIELDS
  ssn WITH '***-**-****',
  patient_name WITH CONCAT(SUBSTRING(patient_name, 1, 1), '***'),
  date_of_birth WITH '****-**-**',
  phone_number WITH '***-***-****',
  email WITH REGEXP_REPLACE(email, '^(.)[^@]+', '$1***')
FOR ROLES 'Developer', 'ProductionDeveloper';
```

